 "summary": "Gateway profile for the Bacharach HGM-MZ: 151 objects (134 AI, 17 AO), all polled. Inputs give the fault code, ppm and alarm level for each of 16 zones, monitor mode and state, active zone, alarm counts, highest concentration and zone, bench sensor readings and refrigerant type per zone; outputs acknowledge alarms per zone or all.",
